{"id":"n25fb29da8c","headline":"Japan June core inflation seen at 1.6% on elevated energy prices: Reuters poll","summary":"Japan's core consumer inflation probably picked up in June from the previous month, a Reuters poll showed. Elevated energy prices and technical factors, including medical fee revisions, are cited.","why":"Core consumer inflation excluding fresh food is the Bank of Japan's key price gauge for setting monetary policy. It shapes expectations for interest rates and the yen.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Tokyo","country":"Japan","lat":35.676,"lon":139.65,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"93.3 The Drive","url":"https://www.933thedrive.com/2026/07/16/japan-june-core-inflation-seen-at-1-6-on-elevated-energy-prices-reuters-poll/"},"sources":[{"name":"93.3 The Drive","url":"https://www.933thedrive.com/2026/07/16/japan-june-core-inflation-seen-at-1-6-on-elevated-energy-prices-reuters-poll/"}],"published_at":"2026-07-17T04:38:07Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"feff7b8f5a4ca000","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-17T04:38:07Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-17T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/city-skyline-business-district-4667143.jpg","alt":"city skyline business district (illustration)","credit":"serbuxarev","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/city-street-architecture-business-4667143/"}}